{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4ca0039d-447c-8dfc-9faa-4abe5027d0a4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:02:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, my name is Isabel Resendes, and I'm calling about a fire hydrant. It's buried. Completely buried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a buried hydrant. Let me get that down. Where is it, Ms. Resendes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my building, 297 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill. The hydrant's at the curb, right by the corner of the lot there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:57:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two ninety-seven Kingston. Got it. And when you say buried, is that from the plow, or was it just the snow piling up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:57:41-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow. Well, I'll tell you what happened. We had that little dusting over the weekend, nothing, really, but before that, the big pile was already there from last time. And the plow came by and pushed more on top. I saw it myself from the window. So I called down to the landlord, and he said, it's the city's hydrant. And I said, well, I know it's the city's, that's why I'm calling them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. And you're a tenant there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent, yes. Second floor. And I'm not out there with a shovel, Kevin, I'm seventy-some years old. It's bitter cold out, too. It's been freezing for days, that snow is like cement now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's a real cold snap, that stuff turns to ice fast. So the hydrant is fully covered, you can't see the top at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see a little bit of the red cap, like a, a thumb sticking out. That's it. And I said to my neighbor, if there's a fire, they'll never find it. And she said, somebody should call. So here I am calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you did the right thing. I'm putting down: hydrant, curb in front of 297 Kingston Avenue, buried by plow bank, cap barely visible, packed ice. Anything else I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that I want it logged. I want it written down that I called today. Because this is not the first time. Last winter the same thing, and I called, and nobody ever said anything to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's logged for today, Monday, the ninth. I'll flag it for the crew that handles hydrant clearing so it gets looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And when would that be? Because I don't want to hear next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hydrants are a priority, so they usually get hit before the regular cleanup. I'd say you should see someone in the next day or two, depending on what else is going on out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. I said to my friend yesterday, the city is going to say a day or two, and she said, well, that's better than nothing. And I said, we'll see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. If you want, I can take a callback number so someone can let you know when it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0185. That's the house phone, I don't use the cell much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-five. That's what I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And I'll tell you, it's not only the hydrant. The whole corner is a mess. I walk to the market on Broadway, I get everything there, and I have to go out in the street because the sidewalk is blocked by the pile. With ice. At my age."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not safe. Let me add that to the notes. Sidewalk blocked at the same corner, pedestrians walking in the road. I'll pass that along with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please do. Because I said to the man at the market, I'm going to fall one of these days, and he said, Isabel, be careful. Be careful. That's all anybody says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hopefully we can get it cleared so you don't have to be that careful. Anything else for me this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Just please get that hydrant dug out. I'll be watching out my window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do, Ms. Resendes. Stay warm, and keep off that ice if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:01:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Kevin. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
